# Build context optimisation for `docker build -f build/Dockerfile .`
# At runtime the script reads the repo from the bind-mounted /repo, so the
# image itself doesn't need any of these. Keeping the context small makes
# `docker build` fast and avoids shipping GBs of node_modules into the daemon.

node_modules/
dist/
.git/
.github/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
build/kente-server/
ejs-cores/
roms/
saves/
bios/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
tmp_*
.tmp_*
build/ps4-bzImage.local
